  "commemorates": "JetBlue's partnership with Peacock, NBCUniversal's streaming service (Peacock in JetBlue's seatback TV).",
  "description": "Fuselage: black, with a bright yellow nose, its edge sweeping down and back from the cockpit to under the forward door, and a yellow tail cone; four big half-discs rising from the belly along the lower aft fuselage, blue, purple, red and orange from front to back. Titles: 'jetBlue' in white over the forward windows with Peacock's wordmark and its six coloured dots after it, divided by a thin white bar. Tail: black fin with a yellow tip and Peacock's white 'p' and column of six coloured dots. Engines black.",
