  "notes": "Measured on the right side only (N706JB landing at JFK, 2024-04-28, flipped); the left side is taken to be the same layout, with 'jetBlue' forward. Peacock's 'p', dots and wordmark are NBCUniversal's artwork: described with `licensed`, not proposed as marks. The half-discs are drawn flat; on the aircraft each shades from its colour at the top to dark at the belly. 'This Peacock Can Fly' (small white script under the cockpit), 'Exclusive streaming partner of jetBlue' and the yellow door outlines aren't drawn. Status: the newest open photo is April 2024; flight-tracking listings show it flying through mid-2025 (leads only); no repaint reported."
